                                "sense_id": "1903ebf6-ea02-30fb-8346-fa65342bdb4a",
                                "text": "She really wants to get the point across that impalement is serious. I think she's going to moulage a few actors and have them stumble in to really scare the class."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88425b6c-6bc9-4ced-900b-e2eaa64943cd",
                                "sense_id": "1903ebf6-ea02-30fb-8346-fa65342bdb4a",
                                "text": "'You can describe wound symptoms, like bruising or bleeding, or you can moulage a \"victim\" and let the students actually see the injury.'"
